C(361,'dynamic','接觸力離線受流率與測試不確定度~Contact force contact loss and test uncertainty',
 '受電弓與電車線耦合時，平均接觸力、力的散布、離線與電弧必須分開量測，單一平均值無法描述短暫中斷~Coupled pantograph and contact-line behavior requires separate measures of mean force, dispersion, loss of contact and arcing; a mean cannot describe brief interruptions',
 '低載弓弦模型、合成接觸力與同步影像~low-load pantograph-string models, synthetic contact force and synchronized images',
 '縮減線性動態與離線資料統計~reduced linear dynamics and offline signal statistics',
 '''平均接觸力~Mean contact force | F1[N]=90; F2[N]=110; F3[N]=130 | (F1+F2+F3)/3 | N | 平均力描述時窗中央趨勢而不保證持續接觸~Mean force describes the central tendency of a window without guaranteeing continuous contact | 最小力與接觸影像~minimum force and contact images | 正常平均可同時含零接觸片段~A normal mean can include zero-contact intervals | 等時距三筆合成取樣~Three equally spaced synthetic samples | 低載力計與同步攝影~low-load force gauge and synchronized video
接觸力均方根~Contact-force RMS | F1[N]=80; F2[N]=100; F3[N]=120 | sqrt((F1**2+F2**2+F3**2)/3) | N | 均方根與算術平均反映不同的力統計~RMS and arithmetic mean describe different force statistics | 完整力時序與均值~complete force time history and mean | 少數尖峰可提高均方根卻被平均掩蓋~A few peaks raise RMS while a mean hides them | 等權有限樣本均方根~Equal-weight finite-sample RMS | 離線力資料與校正表~offline force data and calibration sheet
力散布標準差~Contact-force population deviation | F1[N]=80; F2[N]=100; F3[N]=120 | sqrt(((F1-(F1+F2+F3)/3)**2+(F2-(F1+F2+F3)/3)**2+(F3-(F1+F2+F3)/3)**2)/3) | N | 全體樣本標準差量化此時窗相對均值的散布~Population deviation quantifies spread about the mean in this window | 時窗分段後散布~spread in segmented windows | 混合不同速度時窗會把工況差當隨機散布~Mixing speed regimes confuses operating changes with random spread | 三個等權樣本的全體標準差，式內平均隨擾動重算~Population deviation of three equally weighted samples, with the mean recalculated inside the expression | 合成時序分段統計~segmented statistics of a synthetic trace
離線時間比例~Loss-of-contact duration fraction | lost[s]=0.08; total[s]=20 | lost/total*100 | percent | 持續時間比與離線事件數是不同指標~Duration fraction and number of contact-loss events are different metrics | 離線起迄時間與事件數~contact-loss start/end times and event count | 相同事件數可能有完全不同中斷時間~Equal event counts can conceal very different interruption durations | 固定辨識門檻的合成時窗~Synthetic window with a fixed detection definition | 接觸狀態重播與共同時鐘~contact-state replay and common clock
電弧事件時間~Arc-event exposure fraction | arc[ms]=12; test[s]=30 | arc/(test*1000)*100 | percent | 電弧時間需定義偵測頻寬與事件合併規則~Arc duration requires defined sensing bandwidth and event-merging rules | 光學事件與電流同步~optical events synchronized with current | 外界閃光可能造成假電弧事件~External flashes may create false arc detections | 僅用既有合成事件，不產生真實電弧~Use synthetic recorded events only, without creating real arcs | 合成光電訊號與時間戳~synthetic optical/electrical signals and timestamps
接觸點抬升量~Contact-point uplift scale | F[N]=100; k[N/m]=12000 | F/k*1000 | mm | 線性等效剛度把接觸力連到局部抬升~Linear equivalent stiffness links contact force to local uplift | 接觸點與支點位移~contact and support displacements | 把跨中剛度套到吊點會錯估抬升~Using midspan stiffness at a dropper misestimates uplift | 指定接觸位置的靜態等效剛度~Static equivalent stiffness at a specified contact position | 低載弦模型與雷射位移~low-load string model and laser displacement
弓頭慣性修正~Pantograph-head inertia correction | m[kg]=8; a[m/s2]=2 | m*a | N | 加速度造成慣性項，感測器內力不一定直接等於接觸力~Acceleration produces an inertia term, so measured internal force may differ from contact force | 加速度與力的共同相位~common phase of acceleration and force | 質量或加速度正負號錯誤會加倍偏差~Wrong mass or acceleration sign can increase bias | 剛性弓頭的一維平動~One-dimensional rigid-head translation | 模型力計與加速度計~model force gauge and accelerometer
測試訊號取樣~Test-signal sample interval | fs[Hz]=2000 | 1/fs*1000 | ms | 取樣間隔決定離散時間點但不能替代抗混疊濾波~Sample interval defines discrete timing but does not replace anti-alias filtering | 原始頻寬與取樣設定~original bandwidth and sampling settings | 超頻成分折返會產生假低頻振動~Out-of-band content aliases into false low frequencies | 均勻取樣且時鐘穩定~Uniform sampling with a stable clock | 合成掃頻與濾波紀錄~synthetic frequency sweep and filter records
感測延遲位置偏移~Sensor-delay spatial offset | v[m/s]=80; delay[s]=0.004 | v*delay | m | 時延經車速轉換為里程錯位~Time delay becomes chainage error through train speed | 訊號對時與里程標記~signal synchronization and chainage markers | 未校正時延會把缺陷定位到錯誤吊點~Uncorrected delay assigns a defect to the wrong dropper | 延遲期間等速~Constant speed during the delay | 共同脈衝與里程資料~common timing pulse and chainage data
合成量測不確定度~Combined force uncertainty | sensor[N]=2; inertia[N]=3; sync[N]=1 | sqrt(sensor**2+inertia**2+sync**2) | N | 獨立標準不確定度可平方和合成，相關項須加共變異~Independent standard uncertainties combine by root-sum-square; correlated terms require covariance | 各項校正與相關性~calibration and correlation of each contribution | 把共同偏差當獨立會低估力不確定度~Treating shared bias as independent understates uncertainty | 零共變異的一階近似~First-order approximation with zero covariance | 校正證據與重複測試~calibration evidence and repeat tests''')

C(362,'electric','牽引變壓整流負載與保護邊界~Traction transformation rectification load and protection boundaries',
 '變電所整合需要分辨電壓層級、交流相量、直流回路與能量帳，額定設備容量不能直接代表供電區間可同時支援的列車數~Substation integration distinguishes voltage levels, AC phasors, DC circuits and energy balances; equipment ratings do not directly establish how many trains a feeding section supports',
 '隔離低壓電路與合成供電負載曲線~isolated low-voltage circuits and synthetic traction load curves',
 '集中參數穩態模型，非真實送電或保護設定~lumped steady-state models, not real energization or protection settings',
 '''變壓器電壓比~Transformer voltage ratio | primary[V]=25000; ratio[1]=25 | primary/ratio | V | 理想匝數比改變電壓而近似保存功率~An ideal turns ratio changes voltage while approximately conserving power | 次側空載電壓與匝比~secondary no-load voltage and turns ratio | 負載壓降使實測值偏離理想比~Load voltage drop separates measured voltage from the ideal ratio | 理想單相變壓器幅值比~Ideal single-phase transformer magnitude ratio | 隔離低壓縮比變壓器~isolated low-voltage scaled transformer
三相視在功率~Three-phase apparent power | Vline[V]=11000; Iline[A]=500 | sqrt(3)*Vline*Iline/1e6 | MVA | 線電壓與線電流的三相關係包含根號三~The three-phase relation between line voltage and line current includes square root of three | 三相電壓電流與平衡度~three-phase voltage, current and balance | 混用相電壓與線電壓造成比例誤差~Mixing phase and line voltage creates a scale error | 平衡三相正弦系統~Balanced sinusoidal three-phase system | 合成三相功率分析資料~synthetic three-phase power-analyzer data
實功率與功因~Real power and power factor | S[MVA]=10; pf[1]=0.9 | S*pf | MW | 功率因數把視在功率分成可用實功部分~Power factor relates apparent power to real power | 有功無功與波形~real/reactive power and waveforms | 畸變功因不能只用相位角描述~Distortion power factor is not described by phase angle alone | 已知總功率因數~Known total power factor | 合成功率分析儀輸出~synthetic power-analyzer output
整流理想平均電壓~Ideal rectifier mean voltage | Vll[V]=600 | 3*sqrt(2)/pi*Vll | V | 六脈波理想整流平均值取決於交流線電壓~Ideal six-pulse mean DC voltage depends on AC line voltage | 直流均值與交流線電壓~DC mean and AC line voltage | 換相壓降與元件壓降使真值較低~Commutation and device drops reduce the actual value | 連續電流理想三相二極體橋~Ideal three-phase diode bridge with continuous current | 離線整流波形模擬~offline rectifier-waveform simulation
供電線路壓降~Feeder voltage drop | I[A]=1500; R[ohm]=0.06 | I*R | V | 回路電阻與電流共同消耗受電端電壓~Loop resistance and current consume receiving-end voltage | 源端與負載端電壓~source and load terminal voltages | 只計去路導線會漏掉回流壓降~Counting only the outgoing conductor misses return drop | 直流穩態完整回路~Complete DC loop in steady state | 隔離低壓雙端電壓量測~isolated low-voltage measurements at both ends
設備效率能量帳~Equipment efficiency energy account | Ein[kWh]=1000; eta[1]=0.97 | Ein*eta | kWh | 效率連結相同邊界與時窗的輸入輸出能量~Efficiency relates input and output energy on the same boundary and window | 兩側電能積分~energy integration at both terminals | 輔助負載遺漏會高估整站效率~Omitted auxiliary loads overstate station efficiency | 固定效率與同時窗~Fixed efficiency over one common window | 合成電表資料與輔機帳~synthetic meter records and auxiliary ledger
尖峰需求滑動平均~Moving-average peak demand | E[kWh]=600; minutes[min]=15 | E/(minutes/60) | kW | 需量是指定時窗能量除時間而非瞬時功率~Demand divides window energy by duration rather than taking instantaneous power | 滑動時窗與電能~moving windows and electrical energy | 時窗對齊不同可改變記錄尖峰~Different window alignment changes recorded peaks | 固定十五分鐘觀察窗~Specified fifteen-minute observation window | 合成分鐘電能時間序列~synthetic minute-energy time series
短路等效電流~Equivalent short-circuit current | V[V]=1000; Z[ohm]=0.1 | V/Z | A | 故障電流受等效源阻抗而不只由額定電流決定~Fault current depends on source impedance rather than rated current alone | 等效源阻抗與波形~equivalent source impedance and waveform | 忽略源阻抗會得到不合理無限電流~Omitting source impedance implies unphysical infinite current | 僅離線線性等效幅值，不含直流偏置~Offline linear equivalent magnitude without DC offset | 紙上戴維寧模型與合成波形~paper Thevenin model and synthetic waveform
母線熱損耗~Busbar thermal loss | I[A]=2000; R[ohm]=0.0002 | I**2*R | W | 接點小電阻在大電流下仍產生明顯熱量~Small joint resistance can generate substantial heat at high current | 接點電阻與溫升~joint resistance and temperature rise | 鬆動接點會提高局部發熱~A loose joint raises local heating | 固定電阻的穩態電損~Steady electrical loss at fixed resistance | 低壓四線模型與熱感測~low-voltage four-wire model and thermal sensing
備援容量算例~Redundant-capacity example | units[count]=3; each[MVA]=10; load[MVA]=16 | (units-1)*each-load | MVA | 一台不可用時的名義餘量仍須檢查網路供電路徑~Nominal reserve after one unavailable unit still requires a viable network path | 供電拓樸與剩餘容量~feeding topology and remaining capacity | 有容量但無連通路徑仍無法供電~Capacity without connectivity cannot supply the load | 相同額定單元且可完全分攤~Equal-rated units with fully shareable loading | 離線單線圖與情境表~offline single-line diagram and scenario table''')

C(363,'electric','第三軌壓降集電靴連續性與熱容量~Third-rail voltage drop shoe continuity and thermal capacity',
 '第三軌供電將接觸幾何與低電壓大電流回路連在一起，供電中斷區、集電靴配置和回流路徑共同影響列車供能~Third-rail supply links contact geometry with a low-voltage high-current circuit; gaps, shoe arrangement and return paths jointly affect train power',
 '絕緣低壓模型與合成列車位置~insulated low-voltage models and synthetic train positions',
 '集中直流與幾何連續性模型~lumped DC and geometric-continuity models',
 '''牽引直流需求~Traction DC current demand | P[kW]=1500; V[V]=750 | P*1000/V | A | 定功率負載在電壓下降時需要更大電流~A constant-power load requires more current as voltage falls | 端電壓與電流~terminal voltage and current | 把電流視為固定會低估低壓負擔~Fixed-current assumptions understate low-voltage loading | 理想定功率負載~Ideal constant-power load | 低壓電子負載的合成資料~synthetic data for a low-voltage electronic load
第三軌電阻~Third-rail resistance | rho[ohm*m]=0.00000003; L[m]=1000; A[m2]=0.003 | rho*L/A | ohm | 大截面降低電阻但材料與接點仍決定回路損耗~Large area reduces resistance while material and joints still determine losses | 四線電阻與溫度~four-terminal resistance and temperature | 接頭阻抗可能主導短段壓降~Joint impedance can dominate a short section | 均溫等截面導軌~Uniform-temperature constant-area rail | 隔離低壓四端量測~isolated low-voltage four-terminal test
供電區段電壓~Feeding-section voltage | Vs[V]=750; I[A]=2000; R[ohm]=0.02 | Vs-I*R | V | 負載端電壓是源電壓扣除完整回路壓降~Load voltage equals source voltage minus complete-loop drop | 源負載兩端及回流電位~source/load voltages and return potential | 忽略並聯列車會低估壓降~Ignoring parallel trains understates drop | 單負載直流穩態~Single-load steady DC circuit | 合成雙端電表資料~synthetic terminal meter data
雙端供電分流~Two-end feeding current split | I[A]=2000; Rleft[ohm]=0.03; Rright[ohm]=0.02 | I*Rright/(Rleft+Rright) | A | 等源電壓兩支路按阻抗反比分流~Two equal-voltage source paths divide current inversely with resistance | 左右饋線電流~left and right feeder currents | 來源電壓不同會增加環流~Unequal source voltages can add circulating current | 兩理想等電壓源及電阻支路~Two ideal equal-voltage sources and resistive branches | 低壓並聯模型電流量測~current measurements on a low-voltage parallel model
集電靴分流~Shoe current sharing | I[A]=1600; shoes[count]=4 | I/shoes | A | 均分假設需各接觸電阻相近且同時導通~Equal sharing needs similar contact resistances and simultaneous conduction | 各靴電流與接觸狀態~individual shoe currents and contact states | 一靴離線會把電流轉移到其他靴~Loss of one shoe transfers current to the others | 理想相同並聯接點~Ideal identical parallel contacts | 隔離低壓四支路模型~isolated low-voltage four-branch model
斷電間隙通過時間~Power-gap passage time | L[m]=8; v[m/s]=16 | L/v | s | 間隙長度除速度給出單一集電點的斷續時間~Gap length divided by speed gives interruption time for one collector | 間隙位置與集電點軌跡~gap positions and collector trajectory | 低速通過使無供電時間延長~Slow passage extends the unpowered interval | 等速單集電點~One collector moving at constant speed | 尺度軌與位置重播~scale track and position replay
集電點幾何餘量~Collector geometric overlap reserve | separation[m]=15; gap[m]=8 | separation-gap | m | 兩集電點間距與間隙長度決定幾何重疊餘量~Collector separation and gap length determine geometric overlap reserve | 所有靴位置與供電分段~all shoe positions and energized sections | 只看最近兩靴可能漏掉另一斷電區~Considering only two shoes can miss another dead section | 單一間隙且兩側同電位~One gap with equal-potential supply on either side | 離線位置與分段圖~offline position and section diagram
導軌熱容量升溫~Rail thermal-capacity rise | Q[J]=90000; m[kg]=100; cp[J/kgK]=500 | Q/(m*cp) | K | 短時間能量除熱容量給出絕熱升溫~Energy divided by thermal capacity gives short-time adiabatic temperature rise | 電損積分與導軌溫度~integrated electrical loss and rail temperature | 忽略局部接點熱集中會低估熱點~Ignoring concentrated joint heat understates hotspots | 均溫絕熱集中熱容量~Uniform adiabatic lumped thermal capacity | 低壓模型熱量帳~low-voltage model heat ledger
膨脹接頭移動~Expansion-joint movement | alpha[1/K]=0.000023; L[m]=20; dT[K]=40 | alpha*L*dT*1000 | mm | 熱伸長需與固定點及接頭位置一致~Thermal growth must be consistent with fixed points and joint locations | 導軌溫度與接頭位移~rail temperature and joint displacement | 固定點改動會改變接頭行程~A changed fixed point alters joint travel | 均溫自由伸縮~Uniform-temperature free expansion | 低溫差模型與位移尺~small-temperature-change model and displacement scale
絕緣漏流量級~Insulation leakage scale | V[V]=750; R[ohm]=1000000 | V/R*1000 | mA | 絕緣電阻與濕污條件共同影響漏流~Insulation resistance and wet contamination affect leakage | 濕污條件與漏流~contamination/moisture conditions and leakage | 局部污染可使整體平均電阻失去代表性~Localized pollution can make a mean resistance misleading | 單一歐姆漏流路徑~One ohmic leakage path | 隔離低壓電阻模型~isolated low-voltage resistor model''')

C(364,'electric','回路電位分流與雜散電荷控制~Return potential current division and stray-charge control',
 '牽引回流、軌地電位與雜散電流是不同量；減少一處電位可能把電流轉向其他路徑，需用完整網路及時間電荷帳判斷~Traction return current, rail-earth potential and stray current are distinct; reducing voltage at one point can divert current elsewhere, requiring a complete network and time-integrated charge',
 '隔離低壓回路與合成地電位剖面~isolated low-voltage loops and synthetic earth-potential profiles',
 '線性直流電阻網路與假想電化學帳~linear DC resistance networks and assumed electrochemical accounts',
 '''鋼軌回流壓降~Rail-return voltage drop | I[A]=1000; R[ohm]=0.015 | I*R | V | 回流鋼軌有限電阻產生沿程電位差~Finite return-rail resistance produces longitudinal potential difference | 回流電流與兩點軌電位~return current and rail potentials at two points | 接續線劣化會增加局部壓降~A degraded bond increases local voltage drop | 穩態單一路徑~Steady single return path | 低壓電阻鏈與差動電表~low-voltage resistor chain and differential voltmeter
平行回流分配~Parallel return sharing | It[A]=1000; Rrail[ohm]=0.02; Rcable[ohm]=0.01 | It*Rcable/(Rrail+Rcable) | A | 平行路徑以相同端電壓按電阻反比分流~Parallel paths share terminal voltage and divide current inversely with resistance | 鋼軌與回流線電流~rail and return-cable currents | 一路中斷會重分配全回路電流~Opening one path redistributes total return current | 兩個純電阻並聯~Two purely resistive parallel paths | 隔離低壓支路電流量測~isolated low-voltage branch-current measurements
軌地漏流導納~Rail-earth leakage conductance | V[V]=10; G[S/km]=0.02; L[km]=2 | V*G*L | A | 分布導納乘長度與電位得到均勻漏流近似~Distributed conductance times length and potential approximates uniform leakage | 軌地電位及分段導納~rail-earth potential and segmented conductance | 軌電位不均時不可用單點代表整段~Nonuniform potential cannot be represented by one point | 均勻電位與導納~Uniform potential and conductance | 低壓梯形電阻網路~low-voltage ladder-resistor network
漏流時間電荷~Leakage charge accumulation | I[A]=0.2; hours[h]=8 | I*hours*3600 | C | 腐蝕相關量需按電流方向與時間積分~Corrosion-related accounting needs current direction integrated over time | 電流正負與持續時間~current sign and duration | 用絕對電流積分會混淆陽極與陰極時段~Integrating absolute current confuses anodic and cathodic periods | 固定方向常電流~Constant current with a fixed direction | 合成有號電流時間序列~synthetic signed current time series
理想法拉第質量~Ideal Faraday mass | Q[C]=5760; M[g/mol]=55.845; z[1]=2; F[C/mol]=96485 | Q*M/(z*F) | g | 電荷依價數與莫耳質量換算理想溶解量~Charge converts to ideal dissolution mass through valence and molar mass | 陽極電荷與材料狀態~anodic charge and material condition | 電流效率與局部反應使真實損失不同~Current efficiency and local reactions change real material loss | 假定鐵二價且百分百電流效率~Assumed divalent iron at one hundred percent current efficiency | 紙上電荷帳與材料假設~paper charge ledger and material assumptions
接續電阻增加~Bond-resistance increase | Rnew[mohm]=0.8; Rbase[mohm]=0.2 | (Rnew-Rbase)/Rbase*100 | percent | 相對增幅應與絕對電阻及量測解析度一起讀~Relative increase needs absolute resistance and measurement resolution | 接續四線電阻與溫度~four-terminal bond resistance and temperature | 接觸探針電阻會偽造劣化趨勢~Probe contact resistance can mimic degradation | 相同溫度的電阻比較~Resistance comparison at matched temperature | 低壓四線比較量測~low-voltage four-terminal comparison
收集回路比例~Collection-circuit current fraction | collected[A]=0.18; leakage[A]=0.25 | collected/leakage*100 | percent | 收集比例只描述定義邊界內的電流帳~Collection fraction describes current accounting within a defined boundary | 收集與未收集分流~collected and uncollected branches | 漏流估計漏項會高估收集效果~Omitted leakage paths overstate collection effectiveness | 同時窗閉合電流帳~Closed current balance over one time window | 分支低壓電流表~branch low-voltage ammeters
土壤均勻電阻~Uniform soil-path resistance | rho[ohm*m]=100; L[m]=2; A[m2]=10 | rho*L/A | ohm | 土壤電阻率需幾何路徑才能換成電阻~Soil resistivity needs path geometry before becoming resistance | 土壤含水及電極幾何~soil moisture and electrode geometry | 真實擴散電流不能套等截面直棒幾何~Real spreading current does not follow constant-area bar geometry | 僅均勻等截面教學路徑~Uniform constant-area teaching path only | 電阻率資料與紙上幾何~resistivity data and paper geometry
參考電極偏移~Reference-electrode offset | measured[V]=0.8; offset[V]=0.15 | measured-offset | V | 參考電極自身偏差會平移所有量測電位~Reference-electrode bias shifts every measured potential | 獨立參考與校正~independent reference and calibration | 使用同一偏移參考重測不會消除偏差~Repeating with the same shifted reference does not remove bias | 已知固定加性偏差~Known fixed additive bias | 低壓參考源與差動電表~low-voltage reference source and differential meter
時間取樣電荷~Sampled charge estimate | I1[A]=0.1; I2[A]=0.3; dt[s]=60 | (I1+I2)/2*dt | C | 梯形積分假定兩樣本間電流線性變化~Trapezoidal integration assumes linear current variation between samples | 更密集取樣電流~more densely sampled current | 稀疏取樣會漏掉短時高電流~Sparse sampling misses brief high-current intervals | 兩樣本線性插值~Linear interpolation between two samples | 合成電流與降採樣比較~synthetic current and downsampling comparison''')

C(365,'material','輪緣與軌頂摩擦位置管理及黏著取捨~Location-specific flange and railhead friction management',
 '輪緣潤滑與軌頂摩擦調節作用位置及目標不同，減少磨耗不能以犧牲牽引制動黏著為代價，需同時追蹤摩擦、磨耗與材料散布~Flange lubrication and top-of-rail friction management act at different locations with different aims; wear reduction must be evaluated alongside traction/braking adhesion and material carryover',
 '低速低載摩擦模型與合成接觸資料~low-speed low-load friction models and synthetic contact data',
 '庫侖摩擦及簡化磨耗近似，不外推實際施藥量~Coulomb friction and simplified wear models, without prescribing real application rates',
 '''黏著牽引上限~Adhesion traction ceiling | mu[1]=0.25; N[kN]=100 | mu*N | kN | 摩擦係數與法向力限制可傳遞切向力~Friction coefficient and normal force limit transferable tangential force | 切向力及法向力~tangential and normal force | 過量潤滑可能降低牽引可用力~Excess lubrication may reduce available traction | 簡化庫侖上限~Simplified Coulomb ceiling | 低載摩擦滑台與荷重元~low-load friction sled and load cells
制動黏著距離~Adhesion-limited braking scale | v[m/s]=20; mu[1]=0.15; g[m/s2]=9.81 | v**2/(2*mu*g) | m | 黏著限制減速度時停距隨摩擦降低而增長~When adhesion limits deceleration, stopping distance grows as friction falls | 減速度與摩擦條件~deceleration and friction condition | 乾燥摩擦外推濕污會低估停距~Dry-friction extrapolation understates wet/contaminated stopping distance | 水平常摩擦且無建立延遲~Level track with constant friction and no build-up delay | 紙上制動模型與合成速度~paper braking model and synthetic speed
滑移速度~Relative sliding speed | wheel[m/s]=20.2; train[m/s]=20 | wheel-train | m/s | 輪周速度和列車速度之差描述縱向滑移~Wheel peripheral speed minus train speed describes longitudinal slip | 輪速及獨立車速~wheel speed and independent vehicle speed | 輪徑誤差會偽造滑移~Wheel-diameter error can mimic slip | 直線單一有效輪徑~Straight travel with one effective wheel radius | 合成編碼器與獨立速度資料~synthetic encoder and independent speed data
縱向蠕滑率~Longitudinal creepage | wheel[m/s]=20.2; train[m/s]=20 | (wheel-train)/train*100 | percent | 蠕滑以相對速度對行車速度正規化，低速須另定義~Creepage normalizes relative speed by travel speed and needs a separate low-speed convention | 速度差與輪徑校正~speed difference and radius calibration | 分母接近零時比率變得不穩定~The ratio becomes unstable near zero speed | 明定非零車速的符號慣例~Defined sign convention at nonzero vehicle speed | 離線速度資料工作表~offline speed-data worksheet
摩擦耗散功率~Friction dissipation power | F[N]=1000; slip[m/s]=0.2 | F*slip | W | 接觸摩擦耗能取決於切向力與相對滑移而非行車速度~Friction dissipation uses tangential force and relative sliding speed rather than train speed | 切向力與相對運動~tangential force and relative motion | 用行車速度代替滑移會高估局部發熱~Substituting train speed for slip overstates local heating | 同向定力與定滑移~Constant resisting force and sliding speed | 低載滑台力與速度~low-load sled force and speed
簡化阿查德磨耗~Simplified Archard wear | K[1]=0.00001; N[N]=1000; s[m]=100; H[Pa]=1000000000 | K*N*s/H*1e9 | mm3 | 磨耗係數依材料與環境而變，不能當普遍常數~Wear coefficient varies with material and environment rather than being universal | 體積損失與載入距離~volume loss and loaded sliding distance | 不同磨耗機制轉換會使線性外推失效~A change of wear mechanism invalidates linear extrapolation | 固定係數輕微磨耗區間~Mild-wear interval with fixed coefficient | 低載試片輪廓與質量~low-load specimen profiles and mass
材料面密度~Applied-material areal density | mass[g]=0.5; area[m2]=2 | mass/area | g/m2 | 平均面密度不表示每一處都有相同膜厚~Mean areal density does not imply uniform film thickness | 面積分布與質量帳~spatial distribution and mass balance | 局部堆積與空白區可共存於相同平均~Local accumulation and bare areas can share one mean | 僅惰性模型材料的面積平均~Area average for inert model material only | 染色紙面模型與天平~dyed paper model and balance
分布衰減量級~Carryover decay scale | initial[1]=1; distance[m]=100; scale[m]=80 | initial*exp(-distance/scale) | 1 | 指數衰減是待驗證的分布模型，不是固定產品性能~Exponential decay is a distribution hypothesis rather than fixed product performance | 沿程惰性標記濃度~inert tracer concentration with distance | 天候與交通改變衰減尺度~Weather and traffic change the decay scale | 固定衰減尺度的一維模型~One-dimensional model with fixed decay length | 紙上模型及惰性標記資料~paper model and inert tracer data
摩擦係數量測~Measured friction coefficient | F[N]=12; N[N]=50 | F/N | 1 | 比值需明定靜摩擦峰或穩態動摩擦~The ratio must distinguish a static peak from steady sliding friction | 力位移曲線與滑動狀態~force-displacement curve and sliding state | 混用靜態峰值和動態均值會誤判調節效果~Mixing static peaks and dynamic means misidentifies treatment effect | 定法向力穩態滑動~Steady sliding at constant normal force | 低載摩擦台同步力計~synchronized force gauges on a low-load friction rig
磨耗改善比例~Wear-reduction fraction | base[mm3]=10; managed[mm3]=7 | (base-managed)/base*100 | percent | 磨耗減幅只在相同荷載距離與材料條件下可比~Wear reduction is comparable only at matched load, distance and material conditions | 對照組與重複樣本~control group and repeat specimens | 磨耗降低仍可能伴隨黏著不足~Reduced wear can coexist with inadequate adhesion | 配對試驗且同一體積測法~Paired tests with the same volume method | 低載試片與盲測輪廓~low-load specimens and blinded profiles''')

C(366,'electric','再生能量回收儲存與功率限制~Regenerative recovery storage and power limits',
 '軌旁儲能需同時滿足能量容量、充放電功率與列車事件時序，再生能量存在並不保證能被當時的儲能設備接收~Wayside storage must satisfy energy capacity, power limits and train-event timing; available regenerative energy does not guarantee that storage can accept it at that moment',
 '隔離低能電容模型與合成列車功率曲線~isolated low-energy capacitor models and synthetic train power curves',
 '簡化能量與功率帳，不操作實際高能電池~simplified power/energy accounts without operating high-energy batteries',
 '''列車動能上限~Train kinetic-energy ceiling | m[kg]=200000; v[m/s]=20 | 0.5*m*v**2/3.6e6 | kWh | 動能是可回收能量的上界之一，阻力與轉換損失需扣除~Kinetic energy is one upper bound on recoverable energy, before resistance and conversion losses | 速度質量與減速能量~speed, mass and deceleration energy | 把全部動能當回收量會高估收益~Treating all kinetic energy as recovery overstates benefit | 水平平動且不含旋轉慣量~Level translational motion excluding rotational inertia | 合成速度與能量帳~synthetic speed and energy ledger
回收轉換能量~Recovered conversion energy | E[kWh]=10; eta[1]=0.85 | E*eta | kWh | 單段效率只屬於其明列輸入輸出邊界~A stage efficiency belongs only to its stated input/output boundary | 轉換前後電能~energy before and after conversion | 重複套用同一損失會低估淨回收~Counting the same loss twice understates recovery | 固定單段效率~Fixed single-stage efficiency | 合成雙端電表~synthetic two-terminal energy meters
功率充電時間~Power-limited charging time | E[kWh]=8; P[kW]=1000 | E/P*3600 | s | 能量除功率給出理想充電時間，短制動事件可能先結束~Energy divided by power gives ideal charge time, but braking may end first | 事件時長與充電功率~event duration and charging power | 只有足夠容量仍可能因功率不足而拒收~Adequate capacity can still reject energy through inadequate power | 恆功率且無充電尾段~Constant power without a charge taper | 合成功率時序積分~integration of synthetic power traces
可用荷電空間~Available state-of-charge headroom | capacity[kWh]=50; SOC[1]=0.7; maximum[1]=0.9 | capacity*(maximum-SOC) | kWh | 可用空間由當下荷電狀態與允許上界決定~Headroom depends on present state of charge and allowed upper bound | 荷電估計與庫倫帳~state-of-charge estimate and coulomb ledger | 估計漂移可能錯判可接收空間~Estimator drift can misidentify available headroom | 線性能量荷電映射~Linear energy-to-state-of-charge mapping | 合成狀態估計與獨立能量帳~synthetic state estimate and independent energy ledger
電容能量窗~Capacitor usable energy window | C[F]=100; Vhigh[V]=50; Vlow[V]=30 | 0.5*C*(Vhigh**2-Vlow**2)/3600 | Wh | 電容能量取決於電壓平方差而非電壓差~Capacitor energy depends on squared-voltage difference rather than voltage difference | 電壓與實際電容量~voltage and measured capacitance | 把能量對電壓作線性外推會錯估容量~Linear energy-voltage extrapolation misestimates capacity | 理想定電容量且不含內阻~Ideal constant capacitance without internal resistance | 隔離低能電容縮比試驗~isolated low-energy scaled capacitor test
內阻瞬時損耗~Internal-resistance instantaneous loss | I[A]=200; R[ohm]=0.01 | I**2*R | W | 大電流經內阻產生平方損耗與發熱~High current produces square-law internal loss and heating | 電流有效值與內阻~RMS current and internal resistance | 脈衝平均電流不能代表平均發熱~Pulse-average current does not represent mean heating | 固定內阻短時近似~Short-time fixed-resistance approximation | 低能電路與合成脈衝~low-energy circuit and synthetic pulses
往返效率~Round-trip efficiency | charge[1]=0.95; discharge[1]=0.94 | charge*discharge*100 | percent | 連續轉換效率相乘而非取平均~Sequential conversion efficiencies multiply rather than average | 相同循環的輸入與輸出~input and output of the same cycle | 忽略待機損耗會高估日常效率~Ignoring standby loss overstates daily efficiency | 同一循環且待機損耗另列~One cycle with standby losses accounted separately | 合成完整循環電能帳~synthetic complete-cycle energy ledger
削峰能量需求~Peak-shaving energy demand | excess[kW]=500; duration[s]=20 | excess*duration/3600 | kWh | 短時大功率削峰可有小能量但高電流需求~Brief high-power peak shaving can need little energy but high current | 削峰功率及時窗~shaving power and time window | 以日平均能量選型會漏掉瞬時功率需求~Sizing from daily energy misses instantaneous power needs | 矩形功率脈衝~Rectangular power pulse | 合成列車需求與儲能輸出~synthetic train demand and storage output
每日等效循環~Daily equivalent full cycles | throughput[kWh/day]=600; capacity[kWh]=50 | throughput/(2*capacity) | cycles/day | 充放雙向吞吐量除兩倍容量估算等效循環~Bidirectional throughput divided by twice capacity estimates equivalent cycles | 充放分項電能~separate charge and discharge energy | 深度溫度與倍率差異不能由循環數單獨代表~Cycle count alone does not capture depth, temperature or rate | throughput明定為每日雙向能量總和~Throughput explicitly denotes daily bidirectional energy | 合成每日充放電帳~synthetic daily charge/discharge ledger
再生能量接收比例~Regenerated-energy acceptance fraction | accepted[kWh]=75; available[kWh]=100 | accepted/available*100 | percent | 接收比例受列車時間與儲能狀態共同控制~Acceptance depends jointly on train timing and storage state | 全部制動事件與拒收原因~all braking events and rejection reasons | 只分析成功接收事件會高估利用率~Analyzing only successful events overstates utilization | 同一時窗與電能邊界~Same time window and energy boundary | 合成事件日誌與能量守恆~synthetic event log and energy conservation''')

C(367,'signal','制動包絡定位不確定度與失效保守狀態~Braking envelopes location uncertainty and conservative failure states',
 '列車自動防護把速度位置、路線許可及制動能力組成可持續檢查的包絡，離線算例只解釋邊界，不能作可上線的安全控制器~Automatic train protection combines speed/location, movement authority and braking capability into a continuously checked envelope; offline examples explain boundaries rather than forming a deployable safety controller',
 '合成列車軌跡、狀態機與故障重播~synthetic trajectories, state machines and fault replay',
 '常減速度與離線邏輯模型，不宣稱安全完整性認證~constant-deceleration and offline logic models without safety-integrity certification',
 '''常減速度停距~Constant-deceleration stop distance | v[m/s]=30; a[m/s2]=0.75 | v**2/(2*a) | m | 動能關係使停距隨速度平方增長~Energy balance makes stopping distance grow with speed squared | 速度衰減與制動建立~speed decay and brake build-up | 忽略制動建立與坡度會低估需求~Ignoring build-up and gradient understates required distance | 水平常減速度且無建立延遲~Level constant deceleration with no build-up delay | 合成速度軌跡與時間積分~synthetic speed trace and time integration
處理延遲行程~Processing-delay travel | v[m/s]=30; t[s]=1.2 | v*t | m | 判定與作動延遲期間仍持續前進~Travel continues during decision and actuation delay | 端到端時戳與速度~end-to-end timestamps and speed | 平均延遲不可替代有界最壞延遲~Mean delay cannot replace a bounded worst-case delay | 延遲期間速度固定~Fixed speed during the delay | 離線故障注入與共同時鐘~offline fault injection and common clock
坡度等效減速~Gradient-adjusted deceleration | abrake[m/s2]=0.8; g[m/s2]=9.81; downhill[1]=0.01 | abrake-g*downhill | m/s2 | 下坡重力分量抵消部分制動減速度~Downhill gravity offsets part of the braking deceleration | 坡度位置與制動力~gradient location and braking force | 坡度符號反向會高估可用減速~Reversing gradient sign overstates available deceleration | 小均勻坡度及固定制動力~Small uniform gradient and fixed braking force | 合成坡度與列車受力帳~synthetic gradient and train force balance
可用制動距離~Available braking distance | authority[m]=1000; location[m]=200; uncertainty[m]=15; margin[m]=30 | authority-location-uncertainty-margin | m | 位置不確定度與保留距離消耗許可內的餘量~Location uncertainty and reserve consume distance within authority | 許可端點與位置包絡~authority endpoint and location envelope | 用位置均值代替最前端界限會高估餘量~Using mean location instead of the leading bound overstates reserve | 同方向同基準的區間模型~Same-direction interval model on one datum | 離線區間位置重播~offline interval-location replay
距離反算速度~Distance-based speed inversion | a[m/s2]=0.7; d[m]=500 | sqrt(2*a*d) | m/s | 距離反算速度必須與同一制動假設一致~Inverted speed must use the same braking assumptions as the distance model | 距離與減速假設~distance and deceleration assumptions | 將此縮減速度當完整允許速度會漏掉多重限制~Treating this reduced speed as full permitted speed omits other constraints | 常減速度且已另扣延遲與餘量~Constant deceleration after separately removing delay and reserves | 紙上反算及正向停距驗算~paper inversion and forward stop-distance check
定位誤差成長~Odometry-error growth | bias[1]=0.002; L[m]=5000 | bias*L | m | 比例誤差隨行程累積，需要獨立位置參考收斂~Scale error accumulates with travel and requires an independent position reference | 輪徑校正與定位重置~radius calibration and position-reference reset | 打滑誤差不能只用固定比例描述~Slip error is not fully described by a fixed scale factor | 固定比例偏差而非隨機遊走~Fixed scale bias rather than random walk | 合成里程與獨立標記~synthetic odometry and independent markers
資料新鮮度距離~Data-age distance scale | age[s]=0.5; v[m/s]=30 | age*v | m | 資料年齡對應已移動距離，過期資料不是有效的新許可~Data age corresponds to distance traveled; stale data is not a fresh authority | 發送接收時戳與序號~send/receive timestamps and sequence numbers | 重播舊訊息可能表面合理卻過期~A replayed old message can look plausible while stale | 等速且時鐘基準已校正~Constant speed with corrected clock reference | 離線延遲與重播測試~offline delay and replay tests
離散狀態測試數~Discrete-state test combinations | bits[count]=4 | 2**bits | states | 二元輸入組合數不表示全部狀態皆可達或安全~Binary input combinations do not imply that every state is reachable or safe | 可達性與狀態轉移~reachability and state transitions | 只測單一輸入變化會漏掉組合故障~Testing only individual inputs misses combined faults | 整數二元輸入且另查時間次序~Integer binary inputs with temporal order checked separately | 離線狀態機枚舉~offline state-machine enumeration
測試失敗比例~Observed test-failure fraction | failed[count]=2; tested[count]=1000 | failed/tested*100 | percent | 測試失敗比例不是系統危險失效率認證~Observed test-failure fraction is not certified hazardous failure rate | 測試覆蓋與失效類別~test coverage and failure classification | 人為測試樣本不能直接代表營運曝險~Artificial test cases do not directly represent operating exposure | 指定離線測試集合~Specified offline test set | 可重現情境與結果日誌~reproducible scenarios and result logs
速度量化半格差~Speed quantization half-step | resolution[km/h]=0.5 | resolution/2/3.6 | m/s | 四捨五入量化誤差上界與解析度相連但不含感測偏差~Rounding quantization error is bounded by resolution but excludes sensor bias | 原始速度與顯示速度~raw and displayed speed | 把顯示解析度當總準確度會低估不確定度~Treating display resolution as total accuracy understates uncertainty | 理想最近值四捨五入~Ideal rounding to the nearest displayed value | 合成慢速掃描與誤差圖~synthetic slow sweep and error plot''')
